# Conventional Commits template
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# scope: api, db, auth, ui, i18n, e2e, ci, deps
# subject: imperative, ≤72 chars, no period
#
# Body: explain why (wrap at 72)
# Footer: Closes #123, BREAKING CHANGE:
#
# Example:
# feat(api): add enrollment lifecycle transitions
#
# Enforces status transitions and audit logging.
# Closes #42
